            sampleAnswer: `"It was a presentation about the environmental impacts in my area. I'd spent a long time practising beforehand because I wanted to feel confident and what's more, I absolutely didn't want to read from notes. Having said that, I spoke a bit too quickly at first. I guess even with the practice, I was still nervous. All I can say is when the presentation was over, I felt a huge sense of relief. Overall, I guess I must have been really nervous. Even so, it was a good experience and although I still don't enjoy speaking in front of people, I know I'm more confident now."`,
            prepareTime: 40,
            speakTime: 60
        }];

